<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities vary slightly.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p> Bank of America     11.00 /10.80   11.60 /11.40   12.00 /11.80</p>
<p> Citibank		11.125/10.875  11.625/11.375  12.125/11.95</p>
<p> Multinational	 11.20 /11.00   11.75 /11.35   12.375/12.00</p>
<p> StandChart Bank     11.10 /10.90   11.70 /11.50   12.10 /11.90</p>
<p> Solidbank	     11.10 /10.95   11.70 /11.55   12.00 /11.85</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
